# Google Drive sync — OAuth Desktop app Client ID (set by the developer at build/dev time).
# Create in Google Cloud Console: APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth client ID → Desktop app.
# Enable Google Drive API in the same project.
#
# Local dev/build: copy to .env
# GitHub Actions release: add as repository secret GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
